ing.\r\n- The actual fix is to update the value before the checking the text mismatch from `backedTextInputView`.\r\n\r\nTest Plan:\r\n----------\r\n- When entering 1 character at the beginning of the TextInput, we expect to have only 1 character inserted. However we experience that the character is inserted and the current value is duplicated.\r\n- Insert `0` character before the value `123` with: `<TextInput maxLength={5} />`.\r\n![broken-input](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1864359/47005734-a44fd500-d134-11e8-9ebe-269074bb03a2.gif)\r\n\r\n\r\nRelease Notes:\r\n--------------\r\n[IOS] [BUGFIX] [TextInput] - Fix maxLength property when entering characters at the beginning.\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n![ios-input-fixed](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1864359/46958057-3bffe580-d099-11e8-9087-025c2b7bdb9d.gif)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/21798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/21798/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/436885963","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/21639#issuecomment-436885963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/21639","id":436885963,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzNjg4NTk2Mw==","user":{"login":"JumalDB","id":15668330,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjY4MzMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15668330?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JumalDB","html_url":"https://github.com/JumalDB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JumalDB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JumalDB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JumalDB/gists{/gist_id}","starre